<title>THAILAND: Thai M-2 money supply up 9.1 pct yr/yr in Feb.</title>
<headline>Thai M-2 money supply up 9.1 pct yr/yr in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's M-2 money supply rose 9.1 percent year on year in February against a revised 10.7 percent in January, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the M-2 supply figure rose to an estimated 3.74 trillion baht in February from revised 3.71 trillion in January.</p>
<p>    M-2			 Feb 97     Jan 97	  Feb 96</p>
<p>    Money supply	     3.74	 3.71	     3.43</p>
<p>    Percentage change	 9.1	 10.7	     20.6</p>
<p>Note - Money supply figures are in trillions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-652-0642</p>
</text>
